WEBVTT

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:31.616
kabla hata sijaelewa
kinachoendelea,

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:34.760
Jonathan akavuta nguo yangu kwa makusudi,

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:39.720
na nikaanguka nyuma, nikifikiri nimekufa.

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:44.616
Na mara moja, nilipoangalia juu,

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:48.440
Jonathan Daniels
alikua amesimama mbele ya risasi,

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:51.480
na akachukua mlipuko,

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:54.720
na akaokoa maisha yangu.